// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1628696835" "You defeated 50 Circle of Thorns!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2169119537" "You were not inept in completing this duty. That alone was more than I hoped to see. Very well, but first, there is a small matter that must be dealt with to clear the path to the Thorn Tree."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
