// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P140839688" "The Thorn Tree is a demonic plant that the Circle has brought forth to draw out the power from the ancient ruins of the Mu. They use it's thorns and nettles to make spirit thorns, thorn blades, and all manner of dark and evil things. But this power attracts others. Even now a group of mortals who desire power at any cost plan an attack on the tree. They are called the Malta Group, and you must stop them."
// AcceptString :
"P3679035273" "Prevent Malta Raid"
// SendOffString :
"P1234702979" "Their assault force masses even now in caves beneath the island called Primeva. Eliminate them all, before they can interrupt your attack on the Thorn Tree."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1471783531" "Defeat all Malta Forces"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2592245906" "Speak with me when these mortal interlopers are dealt with."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2066463474" "Malta doesn't play around. There will be a lot of them down here."

