// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P670667641" "I hope you enjoyed this taste of power, for I have greatly enjoyed the revenge it has brought me.  Now, go and speak with Arbiter Lupin. You should be able to find him near Arbiter Frederick. He will guide you through the process of transformation, as you use the power to rebuild yourself. Remove the extraneous, strip away the unwanted. Forge yourself into the perfect instrument of vengeance against all who dared to wrong you!"

